Domain: cond-eff-simplify
Problem: p01
Require:
  :conditional-effects
  :negative-preconditions
  :strips
  :typing
Type:
  item - object
  object
Obj:
  o - item
Predicate:
  (= object object) :eq
  (done item)
  (eff-conflict item)
  (eff-entailed-atom item)
  (eff-fully-entailed item)
  (eff-untouched item)
  (extra item)
  (pre-a item)
  (pre-b item)
Function:
Action:
  process: ?x - item
      pre: (and (pre-a ?x) (pre-b ?x))
      eff: (and (done ?x) (when (and (extra ?x) (pre-a ?x)) (eff-entailed-atom ?x)) (when (and (pre-a ?x) (pre-b ?x)) (eff-fully-entailed ?x)) (when (extra ?x) (eff-untouched ?x)) (when (not (pre-a ?x)) (eff-conflict ?x)))
Init:
  (eff-conflict o)
  (extra o)
  (pre-a o)
  (pre-b o)
Goal:
  (and (done o) (eff-conflict o) (eff-entailed-atom o) (eff-fully-entailed o) (eff-untouched o))
Metric:
Pred prop:
  (done item): in_goal in_eff
  (eff-conflict item): in_init in_goal in_eff
  (eff-entailed-atom item): in_goal in_eff
  (eff-fully-entailed item): in_goal in_eff
  (eff-untouched item): in_goal in_eff
  (extra item): in_init in_pre
  (pre-a item): in_init in_pre in_pre_neg
  (pre-b item): in_init in_pre
Func prop:
Global prop:
  has_cond_eff
  is_unit_cost
